     "sha": "0a2d4c697121839929f080e539d3ccac11e4375d",
     "commit": {
      "message": "refactor: Misc cleanup while playing with config (#17713)\n\n### What does this PR try to resolve?\n\nI made these changes as I worked towards making `[alias]` and\n`alias.foo` deserialize the same way but have abandoned that for now but\nfelt these would still be meaningful without my change.\n\n### Notes to reviewers\n\nFor those curious\n- `StringList` doesn't look like it will work because it looks like it\nis merged and aliases aren't merged\n- `StringOrVec` doesn't work because it looks like an env variable of\n`true` will be `true` and not `\"true\"` and fail deserialiation\n\n---\n\n🤖 LLM involvement: prototyping the changes"
     },
     "html_url": "https://github.com/aphrody-labs/cargo/commit/0a2d4c697121839929f080e539d3ccac11e4375d"
    }
   }
  }
 ],
